1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Welcome to RegDelta. When a regulatory standard updates, we ingest the document, hash its provenance, and extract every requirement.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Before invoking AI, our deterministic code engine aligns versions using Hungarian matching and token overlap—flagging ambiguous shifts for human review.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Next, Gemini analyzes the operational impact, delivering an executive summary and a localized Bangla action plan for regional delivery teams.

4
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Every finding is bound by strict guardrails: source quotes must match page text verbatim, outputs are labeled DRAFT, and we never claim legal compliance.

5
00:00:48,000 --> 00:01:00,000
With full token telemetry, latency tracking, and expert sign-off gates, RegDelta turns regulatory chaos into audit-ready clarity.
